WEBVTT

00:02:29.333 --> 00:02:34.101
But over time, it shared the gifts
of Western wisdom

00:02:34.125 --> 00:02:36.184
with the rest of the world.

00:02:36.208 --> 00:02:40.434
Let me add here that I have
personally benefited

00:02:40.458 --> 00:02:43.059
from the sharing of Western wisdom.

00:02:43.083 --> 00:02:45.393
When I was born in Singapore,

00:02:45.417 --> 00:02:47.976
which was then a poor British colony,

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.768
in 1948,

00:02:49.792 --> 00:02:54.143
I experienced, like three-quarters
of humanity then,

00:02:54.167 --> 00:02:56.059
extreme poverty.

00:02:56.083 --> 00:02:59.309
Indeed, on the first day
when I went to school

00:02:59.333 --> 00:03:00.768
at the age of six,